<title>UK: Abbey National adds 100 mln Ecu to Dec 2000 bond.</title>
<headline>Abbey National adds 100 mln Ecu to Dec 2000 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following fungible bond was</p>
<p>announced by lead manager Paribas.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ABBEY NATIONAL TREASURY SERVICES PLC</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  ABBEY NATIONAL PLC</p>
<p> AMT   *100 MLN ECU   COUPON     5.00	MATURITY    12.DEC.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.862   PAY DATE    29.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    100.487   SPREAD	+17 BP</p>
<p> NOTES     *FUNGIBLE WITH 100 MLN ECU DEAL LAUNCHED 14.NOV.96.</p>
<p>		PAYMENT IS PLUS 47 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST.</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC   1.375</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 9.50 PCT APRIL 2000 OAT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
